Priests are nasty. Because of the healing ability, you can't come
within epsilon of killing him and then stop. You have to guarantee the
kill, or deal with summon insects. Off the top of my head, I can think
of the following strategies:

1. read a scroll of earth and chuck rocks at him.
At a distance, the priest only casts summon insects and "heal self",
so the scroll of earth deals with the insects. You want a ***kton of
rocks; if you really want it done quickly, throw good projectiles
first and rocks when you run out. The important thing is, *don't stop
dealing damage*.

2. Zap him with a wand of polymorph.
He'll still behave like a priest if he's polymorphed, but you'll avoid
incurring murder penalties and he will likely be easier to kill.
You'll unfortunately need several zaps as priests have decent magic
resistance.

3. Use sleep.
Priests are not sleep resistant. The magic resistance may mean that
sleep won't work, but if you've got plenty of zaps or can cast the
spell, do it.

4. DO NOT melee the priest unless magic resistant, preferably with
strong weapon and good AC. You'll also need telepathy, as the priest
will likely blind you.



